Ima
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRUILU 7 FACE_HALF
DRUILU 10 FACE_HALF
DRUILU 9 FACE_HALF
DRUILU 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE DRUILU DRUILU
OR
    DEST Suit {HEARTS, SPADES, DIAMONDS, CLUBS}
    AND
        SRC Rank K
        DEST Rank K
MOVE_STACK DRUILU DRUILU
SRCSTACK Suit match
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DRUILU Empty
    PILE ALL DRUILU Empty
